  "spokenCues": [
    {
      "id": "37.01",
      "text": "We want exactly three seeds to sprout. That means one count, not a range."
    },
    {
      "id": "37.02",
      "text": "On a Calculator page, press Menu. Choose five for Probability, five for Distributions, then the letter D for Binomial P D F."
    },
    {
      "id": "37.03",
      "text": "Enter eight for the number of trials. Tab to the success probability, zero point three. Tab to X Value and enter three."
    },
    {
      "id": "37.04",
      "text": "Press Enter to insert the command. Press Enter again to calculate. The probability of exactly three is about zero point two five four."
    },
    {
      "id": "37.05",
      "text": "At most three would include zero, one, two and three. That’s a cumulative probability. This calculation is for exactly three only."
    }
  ],
